{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538720/extras/TinkererHeader.png?t=1744559294\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way up the Tinkerer's tower, facing dangers as he tries to stop you, discover new abilities, and loot as you ascend to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tower Runner is a medieval-themed, infinite runner. Dive deep into the tower's lore, why it is here, how it is still standing, and who is its master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538720/extras/Screenshot_2025-02-16_at_4.41.40\u202fPM.png?t=1744559294\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538720/extras/FeaturesHeader.png?t=1744559294\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An upward infinite runner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use powerful spells to destroy incoming traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538720/extras/usingrocketability.png?t=1744559294\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the lore behind the tower's existence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find powerful new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an intuitive game design,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And try to go higher and higher every time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538720/extras/death.png?t=1744559294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Try to scale his tower today!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepag